%% 05 — Ingestion Sequence (External → Backend → MongoDB)
sequenceDiagram
  participant EXT as External Caller
  participant BE as Backend<br/>POST /internal/v1/liturgy/import
  participant MG as MongoDB [liturgical_days]

  EXT->>BE: POST /internal/v1/liturgy/import<br/>Bearer LITURGY_IMPORT_TOKEN<br/>LiturgyImportRequest
  activate BE
  BE->>BE: Bearer auth 401/403
  BE->>BE: validate Jakarta @NotBlank/@Valid<br/>text XOR options
  loop per LiturgicalDay
    BE->>MG: findById(date) (unique _id)
    alt not exists
      BE->>MG: insert liturgical_days (embedded readings/sources)
      Note over BE,MG: created++
    else contentHash == incoming
      BE->>MG: update lastVerifiedAt
      Note over BE,MG: unchanged++ (NO-OP)
    else contentHash != incoming
      BE->>MG: replace liturgical_days
      Note over BE,MG: updated++
    end
  end
  BE-->>EXT: 200 {importId, SUCCESS, processed, created, updated, unchanged}
  deactivate BE
